OL,3,APrince George begins first day at Eton
OL,4,ACollege
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrince George is taking another step in
OL,7,Fgrowing up with his first day at Eton
OL,8,FCollege.
OL,10,FHe is following in the footsteps of his
OL,11,Ffather, the Prince of Wales, who also
OL,12,Fattended the historic school in
OL,13,FBerkshire.
OL,15,FThe 13-year-old prince will become a
OL,16,Fboarder at the elite private school,
OL,17,Fwhich has taught 20 British prime
OL,18,Fministers and where fees are around
OL,19,F#65,000 a year.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
